<title>SOUTH AFRICA: SASANI SAYS ACQUISITION TALKS CONTINUE.</title>
<headline>SASANI SAYS ACQUISITION TALKS CONTINUE.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-05-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sasani Ltd said on Friday that negotiations regarding further acquisitions by the company were still taking place.</p>
<p>It said shareholders should exercise caution in their dealings.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482-1003</p>
</text>
